Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:41.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:41.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:46.66,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:47.55,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:51.36,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:55.86,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:58.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:00.88,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:03.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:08.12,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:12.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:17.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:17.08,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:21.70,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:20.88,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:21.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:22.72,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:27.08,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:26.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.71,0:02:27.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:28.27,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:32.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:36.20,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:38.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:39.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.45,0:02:41.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:45.05,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:44.75,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:47.71,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.75,0:02:47.26,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:50.04,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.59,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:53.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:54.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:58.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,1. 2. 3. 4 Precure（5!）
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default CN,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.93,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.93,0:22:19.64,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:22.48,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:26.25,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yeah~！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.28,0:22:39.18,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,像椰子和果仁那般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:41.13,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,柔軟甜美的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.33,0:22:45.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,沉醉其中时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:47.38,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.46,0:22:50.47,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,得把窗帘打开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.93,0:22:53.47,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,去寻找梦的续集
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:57.11,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,希望那灿烂的阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.11,0:22:59.31,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,不要把我的心溶化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:00.64,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Oh～！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:06.40,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,太阳公公的表情多么开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.64,0:23:12.40,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为何可以笑得这么开怀!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:18.24,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,其实我的心情也是同样明亮的 color
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.24,0:23:23.29,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闪闪发亮吧 My True Love！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:28.34,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.34,0:23:31.12,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.21,0:23:33.47,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.75,0:23:35.18,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.77,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,最棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.77,0:23:40.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
